<title>UK: Matra Marconi Space wins DTH satellite contract.</title>
<headline>Matra Marconi Space wins DTH satellite contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matra Marconi Space said on Monday it had been awarded the contract for the supply of direct-to-home television satellites to Intelsat.</p>
<p>Matra Marconi Space is the joint venture company formed by Lagardere of France and GEC Plc of the UK. The venture did not state what the value of the contract was.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
